			PLT source code

The source code contined in the file pltsc.zip should be extracted with
"pkunzip -d pltsc" to maintain the subdirectory structure.  The plt
source code can be rebuilt with MSC version 6.00.  One additional
library file (lgrlib.lib) will be require for linking.  The souce code
for grlib is in a separate file (grlibsc.zip). 

